  "description": "Want to make resource gathering even §6easier§r? Craft the §aearth sieve§r and pair it with the §7rock breaker§r for a convenient source of §bores§r! While §dmining§r is still recommended (as the sieve §ccan not§r yield every §bore§r), this machine offers a significant §2boost§r.

